      "updated": 1785240293549,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TITLE: New Subscription Wizard\n------------------------------\n\nSQL Server could not create a subscription for Subscriber 'DISMONTFLIC\\MSSQLSERVERTT'.\n\n------------------------------\nADDITIONAL INFORMATION:\n\nAn exception occurred while executing a Transact-SQL statement or batch.\n(Microsoft.SqlServer.ConnectionInfo)\n\n------------------------------\n\nProxy \"SRV-JD-FIGUEIRA\\Repl_Merge\" is not a valid Windows user.\nChanged database context to 'ecm_copel_jdfigueira'.\nDBCC execution completed. If DBCC printed error messages, contact your system administrator.\nDBCC execution completed. If DBCC printed error messages, contact your system administrator.\nWARNING: The database 'ecm_copel_jdfigueira' does not contain database master key. Create a database\nmaster key and then update all replication secrets in this database. For more information, see\nhttps://aka.ms/sql-tr-dmk-warning-troubleshooting.\nDBCC execution completed. If DBCC printed error messages, contact your system administrator.\nDBCC execution completed. If DBCC printed error messages, contact your system administrator.\nWARNING: The database 'ecm_copel_jdfigueira' does not contain database master key. Create a database\nmaster key and then update all replication secrets in this database. For more information, see\nhttps://aka.ms/sql-tr-dmk-warning-troubleshooting. (Microsoft SQL Server, Error: 14529)",
      "fontSize": 7.781880559101957,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TITLE: New Subscription Wizard\n------------------------------\n\nSQL Server could not create a subscription for Subscriber 'DISMONTFLIC\\MSSQLSERVERTT'.\n\n------------------------------\nADDITIONAL INFORMATION:\n\nAn exception occurred while executing a Transact-SQL statement or batch. (Microsoft.SqlServer.ConnectionInfo)\n\n------------------------------\n\nProxy \"SRV-JD-FIGUEIRA\\Repl_Merge\" is not a valid Windows user.\nChanged database context to 'ecm_copel_jdfigueira'.\nDBCC execution completed. If DBCC printed error messages, contact your system administrator.\nDBCC execution completed. If DBCC printed error messages, contact your system administrator.\nWARNING: The database 'ecm_copel_jdfigueira' does not contain database master key. Create a database master key and then update all replication secrets in this database. For more information, see https://aka.ms/sql-tr-dmk-warning-troubleshooting.\nDBCC execution completed. If DBCC printed error messages, contact your system administrator.\nDBCC execution completed. If DBCC printed error messages, contact your system administrator.\nWARNING: The database 'ecm_copel_jdfigueira' does not contain database master key. Create a database master key and then update all replication secrets in this database. For more information, see https://aka.ms/sql-tr-dmk-warning-troubleshooting. (Microsoft SQL Server, Error: 14529)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
